{"scene_id": "s02158", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s02158.fountain", "heading": "INT. KESTREL RIDGE RADIO OBSERVATORY - CONTROL ROOM - NIGHT", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "EMERY ASHWORTH", "names": ["EMERY ASHWORTH", "EMERY"], "gender": "m", "first": 6, "spoke": 21}, {"id": 1, "name": "LYDIA THORNQUIST", "names": ["LYDIA THORNQUIST"], "gender": "?", "first": 8, "spoke": 18}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. KESTREL RIDGE RADIO OBSERVATORY - CONTROL ROOM - NIGHT", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A circular room of pale concrete.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Monitors in a horseshoe; a dozen cold, two lit.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "A coffee machine murmuring in the corner.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "The great dish outside is a black silhouette against the stars, motionless.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Wind needles the shutters.", "para": 0, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "DR. EMERY ASHWORTH, 50s, cardigan, thick glasses on a lanyard, sits at the central console with one hand on a mouse and the other cradling a heavy black telephone to his ear.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "He listens with an expression of such perfect courtesy that it has stopped being an expression.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Emery, the board met this morning.", "name": "LYDIA THORNQUIST", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": ["phone"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Yes.", "name": "EMERY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "They want the dish decommissioned by spring.", "name": "LYDIA THORNQUIST", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I see.", "name": "EMERY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You see.", "name": "LYDIA THORNQUIST", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I see, Lydia.", "name": "EMERY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "A long pause on the line.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "He turns his chair a few degrees.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "A green line crawls along one monitor and stops.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Emery, you've been listening to that patch of sky for thirty-one years.", "name": "LYDIA THORNQUIST", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Thirty-two in November.", "name": "EMERY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And in that time, how many signals?", "name": "LYDIA THORNQUIST", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "One.", "name": "EMERY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "One.", "name": "LYDIA THORNQUIST", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "In 1998.", "name": "EMERY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And it was a satellite.", "name": "LYDIA THORNQUIST", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It was a satellite that behaved strangely.", "name": "EMERY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Emery.", "name": "LYDIA THORNQUIST", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Lydia.", "name": "EMERY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "He reaches over, with his free hand, and presses a button on the console.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "A second monitor wakes: a spectrogram, bright in the center, trailing off at the edges.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "What is that?", "name": "LYDIA THORNQUIST", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Tonight's data.", "name": "EMERY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It looks like noise.", "name": "LYDIA THORNQUIST", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It looks like noise at first.", "name": "EMERY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "He lifts a pencil.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Taps the glass at three points in the display.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Each tap lands on a bright line.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Three narrow peaks. Spaced exactly one hydrogen line apart.", "name": "EMERY", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Meaning?", "name": "LYDIA THORNQUIST", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Meaning nothing natural spaces itself that way.", "name": "EMERY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Silence on the line.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "For the first time Emery lowers his voice.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Lydia, I would like to request that you tell the board the dish stays.", "name": "EMERY", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "How long has it been repeating?", "name": "LYDIA THORNQUIST", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Eleven minutes.", "name": "EMERY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Have you told anyone?", "name": "LYDIA THORNQUIST", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm telling you.", "name": "EMERY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Emery, if this is a joke...", "name": "LYDIA THORNQUIST", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's not a joke.", "name": "EMERY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "If this is a glitch...", "name": "LYDIA THORNQUIST", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It is not a glitch.", "name": "EMERY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "Wind needles the shutters.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "The monitor pulses, once, twice, in a rhythm so regular it hurts.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm coming up.", "name": "LYDIA THORNQUIST", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Lydia, the road is washed out.", "name": "EMERY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then I'll walk.", "name": "LYDIA THORNQUIST", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's sixty miles.", "name": "EMERY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then keep listening.", "name": "LYDIA THORNQUIST", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "The line clicks.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "Emery sets the phone in its cradle, slowly, as if it might break.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "He turns to the monitor.", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Rolls his chair in until his glasses nearly touch the glass.", "para": 7, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 61, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Hello.", "name": "EMERY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["softly, to the screen"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "The pulse repeats.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "Exactly the same.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "Exactly as long.", "para": 8, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 65, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Hello. I'm here.", "name": "EMERY", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}]}